<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 23.23 pct, 3-mo 23.10 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 23.23 pct, 3-mo 23.10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) was fixed at 23.23 percent, up from 23.22, for the one-month maturity, while it remained steady at 23.10 percent for three months, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom, +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
